{
  "name": "tracedecay_context_relevance_eval",
  "description": "Labeled relevance eval for tracedecay_context against the frozen fixture project tests/fixtures/context_eval_project/. Each case is a natural-language task phrased like real usage. `relevant` is the allowed set of qualified names that count as a hit within the top 5 ranked entry_points (recall@5). `required_top3` is a subset of `relevant` that must appear within the top 3 ranked entry_points (anchor hit rate). Metrics are recomputed by the test from the live tracedecay_context output, so a fixture whose expected metrics disagree with its own cases fails loudly.",
